      "rationale": "The CSRM is a reusable CubeSat-system reference model/sandbox and logical architecture intended to be instantiated and tailored by mission teams. The paper supports high-level abstraction and mission-agnostic architecture, but not interface-focused model, low-dynamics / non-detailed-behavior model, or specific-mission model with reusable method only.",
